      <title>Pitch | HU Entrepreneurial Program</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/53789519731064/huge/320711ca516a555476145b3ec049e32c0aa0fe6f.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Mon, 31 Aug 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>Offered by the HU Tech Transfer Office - Pitch|HU is a six-week entrepreneurial program that equips participants with National Science Foundation (NSF) I-Corps customer discovery tools &amp; commercialization strategies to transform ideas into market-ready solutions.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Have an idea, innovation, research project, creative work, or solution with real-world potential? This is your invitation to take it further.
<br> </p>

<p>Pitch|HU welcomes Howard faculty, staff, students, alumni, HBCU affiliates, and innovators from our surrounding communities to participate in a six-week entrepreneurial experience designed to help turn ideas into commercial pathways, ventures, and impact.
<br> </p>

<p>Apply by Monday, August 31, 2026. Once your application is received, you’ll immediately receive instructions to begin the required NSF I-Corps Pre-Work, which is embedded into the Pitch|HU experience.
<br> </p>

<p>Your idea has potential. Let’s discover where it can go. Apply today!</p>

<p><a href="https://events.howard.edu/event/pitchhu-fall-2026-cohort">View on site</a> | <a href="mailto:?subject=I found an interesting event%3A Pitch %7C HU Entrepreneurial Program&amp;body=I found an interesting event you may like%3A%0A%0A%0ADate%3A Aug 31%2C 2026%0A%0ADescription%3A%0AOffered by the HU Tech Transfer Office - Pitch%7CHU is a six-week entrepreneurial program that equips participants with National Science Foundation %28NSF%29 I-Corps customer discovery tools %26 commercialization strategies to transform ideas into market-ready solutions.%0A%0A %0A%0AHave an idea%2C innovation%2C research project%2C creative work%2C or solution with real-world potential%3F This is your invitation to take it further.%0A %0A%0APitch%7CHU welcomes Howard faculty%2C staff%2C students%2C alumni%2C HBCU affiliates%2C and innovators from our surrounding communities to participate in a six-week entrepreneurial experience designed to help turn ideas into commercial pathways%2C ventures%2C and impact.%0A %0A%0AApply by Monday%2C August 31%2C 2026. Once your application is received%2C you%E2%80%99ll immediately receive instructions to begin the required NSF I-Corps Pre-Work%2C which is embedded into the Pitch%7CHU experience.%0A %0A%0AYour idea has potential. Let%E2%80%99s discover where it can go. Apply today%21%0A%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fevents.howard.edu%2Fevent%2Fpitchhu-fall-2026-cohort%0A">Email this event</a></p></div></div>]]></description>
