      <title>Campus-Wide Walking Challenge at Blackburn Center (Armour J. Blackburn University Center)</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/53684226218179/huge/4a3eac54584e40d2c088b64204cfc1f235443359.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Mon, 31 Aug 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>All faculty and staff are invited to participate in a campus-wide walking challenge from August 24-October 2. Participants will enroll, set goals, and track their daily steps.</p>

<p>Walking lowers the risk of heart disease, helps manage weight, and strengthens muscles. It can also reduce stress, clear the mind, and improve daily mood.</p>

<p>To support the challenge, an in-person launch will be held on Monday, August 24, in front of Blackburn Hall. Led by Howard University Wellness Champion Alisha McDougal and supported by the HR, Wellness, and Benefits team, participants will gather and walk together in a shady area around campus.</p>

<p>The in-person group walk will continue every Monday during the challenge. Please bring your walking shoes and water.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>For more information, contact Alisha McDougal at <a href="mailto:Alisha.McDougal@Howard.edu">Alisha.McDougal@Howard.edu</a> or Onsite Health Coach Katherine Smith at <a href="mailto:Katherine.Smith@Evernorth.com">Katherine.Smith@Evernorth.com</a>.</p>

<p><a href="https://events.howard.edu/event/campus-wide-walking-challenge">View on site</a> | <a href="mailto:?subject=I found an interesting event%3A Campus-Wide Walking Challenge&amp;body=I found an interesting event you may like%3A%0A%0A%0ADate%3A Aug 31%2C 2026%0A%0ADescription%3A%0AAll faculty and staff are invited to participate in a campus-wide walking challenge from August 24-October 2. Participants will enroll%2C set goals%2C and track their daily steps.%0A%0A%0AWalking lowers the risk of heart disease%2C helps manage weight%2C and strengthens muscles. It can also reduce stress%2C clear the mind%2C and improve daily mood.%0A%0A%0ATo support the challenge%2C an in-person launch will be held on Monday%2C August 24%2C in front of Blackburn Hall. Led by Howard University Wellness Champion Alisha McDougal and supported by the HR%2C Wellness%2C and Benefits team%2C participants will gather and walk together in a shady area around campus.%0A%0A%0AThe in-person group walk will continue every Monday during the challenge. Please bring your walking shoes and water.%0A%0A %0A%0AFor more information%2C contact Alisha McDougal at Alisha.McDougal%40Howard.edu or Onsite Health Coach Katherine Smith at Katherine.Smith%40Evernorth.com.%0A%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fevents.howard.edu%2Fevent%2Fcampus-wide-walking-challenge%0A">Email this event</a></p></div></div>]]></description>
