    <item>
      <title>Howard University Executive Roundtable: Investing in the African Diaspora </title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/53825049278263/huge/17220c84e7337f0615564094152c5e799d7e4ecc.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Mon, 31 Aug 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>The African diaspora is actively mobilizing its resources, skills, and networks to drive continental growth. While $30.75 billion in remittances flowed to Sub-Saharan Africa in 2025, the real opportunity lies beyond money transfers. Diaspora professionals bring specialized expertise that transcends borders: tech workers can open investment doors and facilitate knowledge transfer, healthcare professionals can bridge research collaborations, finance experts can navigate complex deal structures, and entrepreneurs can unlock new markets. Yet venture capital to African tech startups fell 52% between 2022–2024—not because of a lack of opportunity, but because of coordination gaps and unclear pathways for diaspora capital.</p>

<p>This executive roundtable brings together founders, investors, and policy experts to explore how diaspora professionals—whether through mentorship, strategic investment, skills transfer, or collective giving—can finance businesses, create jobs, and build globally competitive African enterprises. As geopolitical competition for African markets intensifies and the continent's youth population expands rapidly, diaspora engagement is no longer optional—it's strategic.</p>

<p>Join us to learn how to deploy diaspora capital effectively, navigate emerging sectors, and understand the long-term policy environment shaping the continent's growth. Register below!
<br> </p>

<p>Date &amp; Time: Monday, August 31, 2026 | 7 p.m.-8:30 p.m. ETLocation: Virtual - Zoom meeting info will be shared only with registered participants </p>

<p>RSVP! </p>

<p>If you cannot attend, you may submit ideas to <a href="mailto:huexecutiveed@howard.edu">huexecutiveed@howard.edu</a>.</p>

<p><a href="https://events.howard.edu/event/howard-university-executive-roundtable-investing-in-the-african-diaspora">View on site</a> | <a href="mailto:?subject=I found an interesting event%3A Howard University Executive Roundtable%3A Investing in the African Diaspora &amp;body=I found an interesting event you may like%3A%0A%0A%0ADate%3A Aug 31%2C 2026%0A%0ADescription%3A%0AThe African diaspora is actively mobilizing its resources%2C skills%2C and networks to drive continental growth. While %2430.75 billion in remittances flowed to Sub-Saharan Africa in 2025%2C the real opportunity lies beyond money transfers. Diaspora professionals bring specialized expertise that transcends borders%3A tech workers can open investment doors and facilitate knowledge transfer%2C healthcare professionals can bridge research collaborations%2C finance experts can navigate complex deal structures%2C and entrepreneurs can unlock new markets. Yet venture capital to African tech startups fell 52%25 between 2022%E2%80%932024%E2%80%94not because of a lack of opportunity%2C but because of coordination gaps and unclear pathways for diaspora capital.%0A%0A%0AThis executive roundtable brings together founders%2C investors%2C and policy experts to explore how diaspora professionals%E2%80%94whether through mentorship%2C strategic investment%2C skills transfer%2C or collective giving%E2%80%94can finance businesses%2C create jobs%2C and build globally competitive African enterprises. As geopolitical competition for African markets intensifies and the continent%27s youth population expands rapidly%2C diaspora engagement is no longer optional%E2%80%94it%27s strategic.%0A%0AJoin us to learn how to deploy diaspora capital effectively%2C navigate emerging sectors%2C and understand the long-term policy environment shaping the continent%27s growth. Register below%21%0A %0A%0ADate %26 Time%3A Monday%2C August 31%2C 2026 %7C 7 p.m.-8%3A30 p.m. ETLocation%3A Virtual - Zoom meeting info will be shared only with registered participants %0A%0ARSVP%21 %0A%0A%0AIf you cannot attend%2C you may submit ideas to huexecutiveed%40howard.edu.%0A%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fevents.howard.edu%2Fevent%2Fhoward-university-executive-roundtable-investing-in-the-african-diaspora%0A">Email this event</a></p></div></div>]]></description>
