      <title>School of Divinity Virtual Info Sessions</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/52127120234168/huge/1dfaf58c23eeefee309617ebc15a8631065a9ca2.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Fri, 04 Sep 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>School of Divinity Admissions Info Sessions will take place at 12:00 p.m. EST (Zoom) on the following dates: </p>

